{'symbol': 'UAL', 'date': '2023-03-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'UNITED AIRLINES AND ARCHER ANNOUNCE FIRST COMMERCIAL ELECTRIC AIR TAXI ROUTE IN CHICAGO', 'text': "CHICAGO & SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARCHER AVIATION INC. (NYSE: ACHR) AND UNITED AIRLINES (NASDAQ: UAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO LAUNCH THE FIRST AIR TAXI ROUTE IN CHICAGO, BETWEEN O'HARE INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (ORD) AND VERTIPORT CHICAGO. VERTIPORT CHICAGO, NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST VERTICAL AIRCRAFT TAKEOFF AND LANDING FACILITY, IS LOCATED IN THE ILLINOIS MEDICAL DISTRICT NEAR THE CHICAGO LOOP."}